TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}İlkbahar, insanın içinden yeni
kitaplara dalmak gelen mevsim,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}
. {{TAG:0003:002B:}}Acaba beni bekleyen hangi
güzel kitaplar var{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0001:}} {{TAG:0003:0004:}}Ah!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Kalbim heyecandan duracak!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Summer is the season for reading
on the beach,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}Instead of jumping into the ocean,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}I jump into whole other worlds!

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}L'estate {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}è la stagione migliore per{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
leggere sotto il sole, in riva al lago
o sulla spiaggia, {{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}.
Invece che fare un bagno nell'acqua,{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}mi immergerò nella storia romantica
del mio romanzo d'amore!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Yaz, sahilde kitap okumak için
harika,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}Denize atlamak yerine{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0003:0001:}}
bambaşka dünyalara atlıyorum!

{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Sonbahar battaniyeye sarılıp
kitap okumak için biçilmiş
kaftan,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} sence de öyle değil mi?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}
Ben tam bir kitap kurduyum,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Bu sonbahar şimdiden 20 kitap bitirdim!

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Ohne dich überrumpeln zu wollen...{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Weißt du, woran ich eben gedacht
habe?{{TAG:0008:0000:0A0000000D000000}}
An die Zukunft.
An gestern.

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0010:}}That's right!{{TAG:0007:0001:}} {{TAG:0003:0000:}}For a while now I've
been thinking about how to {{TAG:0003:0015:}}live my
life on my own terms.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:000B:}}But...{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}what exactly are my terms?{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}I should really get to know myself
better.

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0010:}}Ah, esatto!{{TAG:0007:0001:}} {{TAG:0003:0000:}}È ormai da un po' che
sto pensando{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} al modo migliore{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}per vivere a modo mio.
{{TAG:0003:000B:}}Ma cosa significa {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}esattamente{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
"a modo mio"?{{TAG:0007:0001:}} {{TAG:0003:0025:}}Mh, dovrò{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}} imparare
a {{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}conoscermi un po' meglio!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0010:}}Doğru!{{TAG:0007:0001:}} {{TAG:0003:0000:}}Bir süredir {{TAG:0003:0015:}}hayatımı
kendi şartlarımla yaşamayı{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
düşünüyorum. {{TAG:0003:000B:}}Ama...{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}benim
şartlarım tam olarak ne?{{TAG:0007:0001:}} {{TAG:0003:0025:}}
Sanırım kendimi biraz daha iyi
tanımam gerek.

{{TAG:0003:000F:}}Hayır!{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} Geleceği düşünmüyorum.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:0003:0000:}}
Şu anda kafam zaten yeterince
dolu! Aslında dün aldığım {{TAG:0005:000F:0000}}'i
nereye koyduğumu düşünüyorum. {{TAG:0003:0009:}}
Bir türlü hatırlayamıyorum.

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0006:}}Cosa?!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Stai scherzando?! Io sono{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}
concentratissima!{{TAG:0007:0001:}} {{TAG:0003:0015:}}Sto pensando
alla nostra conversazione!

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Weißt du, woran ich gerade denke?{{TAG:0008:0000:1400000015000000}}
An Außerirdische?
An kleine gelbe Küken?

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}This might seem sort of random,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
but do you know what I'm thinking
about at this very moment?{{TAG:0008:0000:170000001A000000}}
Gloves.
Socks.

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Posso farti una domanda bizzarra?{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Sai a cosa{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} sto pensando in questo
preciso momento?{{TAG:0008:0000:170000001A000000}}
Ai guanti.
Alle calze.

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Weißt du, woran ich gerade denke?{{TAG:0008:0000:170000001A000000}}
An Handschuhe.
An Socken.

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Biraz alakasız gelebilir ama{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
tam şu anda ne düşündüğümü
biliyor musun?{{TAG:0008:0000:170000001A000000}}
Eldivenleri.
Çorapları.

{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Doğru.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Yeni bir çift eldiven
örmem gerektiğini düşünüyordum.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0027:}}
Geçen denememde{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} kendimi
kaptırıp 13 parmak örmüşüm.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Örgü insanı böyle
dalgınlaştırıyor işte.

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Cierto.{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}} {{TAG:0003:0025:}}Me estaba acordando de que
el otro día fui a casa de {{TAG:0005:0002:}}
{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}y me quité los zapatos al entrar.
{{TAG:0003:0027:}}¡No sabes la vergüenza que me dio
cuando vi que tenía un agujero en
uno de mis calcetines!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}No quería que se diera cuenta, así
que mantuve el pie escondido{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0003:0000:}}{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0029:}}
¡y fui a la pata coja todo el rato!{{TAG:0003:0000:}}
{{TAG:0003:001B:}}Lo bueno es que no se percató de
lo del calcetín, {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}pero me sentí muy
rara dando saltitos por su casa{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0003:0000:}}

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0027:}}Qualche giorno fa,{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} ho trovato per
terra una lettera che {{TAG:0005:0004:00CD}}
deve aver perso{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:000D:}}So che non avrei dovuto leggerla,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} 
ma non ho resistito!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Ti preeego,
non dirlo a nessuno!
Mi sono vergognata così tanto
che l'ho richiusa in fretta e
l'ho lasciata dove l'avevo trovata.
{{TAG:0003:000B:}}Ma ripensandoci,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} forse {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}sarebbe
stato meglio{{TAG:0007:0000:03000000}} metterla nella cassetta
delle lettere di {{TAG:0005:0004:00CD}}{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Chissà se qualcun altro l'ha trovata
e l'ha letta...{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}I picked up a diary that someone
dropped the other day.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:0003:0027:}}I know I
shouldn't have,{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}} but I peeked inside.
{{TAG:0003:0000:}}It said: "Day one: {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}Played a lot.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Day two:{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} Played a lot today too.{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}
Day three:{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} .{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.Sure played a lot."
{{TAG:0003:000D:}}And it was like that on every page!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:001B:}}What's the point in keeping a diary
like that?!

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Neulich habe ich ein Tagebuch
gefunden!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:0003:0027:}}Also...{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} Ich weiß, es war
falsch, aber ich hab reingeschaut...
{{TAG:0003:0000:}}Da stand: „Tag 1: {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}Viel gespielt.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Tag 2:{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} Wieder viel gespielt.{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Tag 3:{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} Richtig viel gespielt!“
{{TAG:0003:000D:}}Und das ging auch so weiter!{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Seite um Seite immer das Gleiche!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Wieso hat wohl jemand so ein
Tagebuch, wenn er jeden Tag
dasselbe macht?

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Lately, I've been into wearing my
pajamas inside out and backward.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Ever since I started doing that,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
I haven't had a single bad dream.

{{TAG:0003:0001:}}I've taken up calligraphy recently.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
But to make it more of a challenge,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
I do it on tissue paper!
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}I can't begin to describe how good
it feels to finish a letter without
tearing the paper!

{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Can I confide in you?{{TAG:0007:0001:}} I pressed some
{{TAG:0005:0021:00CD}} between
books to make decorations later.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Then the other day,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} I mistook them
for tea leaves...{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:000D:}}And I accidentally made {{TAG:0005:0004:00CD}}
drink my pressed-flower tea!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}{{TAG:0003:000F:}}
Please don't tell {{TAG:000E:0007:0600680069006D000600680065007200}} about it!

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Tempo fa ho seccato dei petali
di {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}{{TAG:0005:0021:00CD}}{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
per fare una composizione artistica.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Ma ieri{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}} mi sono sbagliata e li ho
usati per fare una tisana!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:000D:}}Poi l'ho offerta {{TAG:000E:0010:}} {{TAG:0005:0004:00CD}}.
{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}Una tisana di petali secchi...{{TAG:0007:0001:}}{{TAG:0003:0009:}}
Mi raccomando, non dirglielo!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Sana bir sır verebilir miyim?{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
Sonra süs yaparım diye
kitapların arasına {{TAG:0005:0021:00CD}} koymuştum.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0009:}}
Geçen gün{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} onları çay yaprağı
