kurutulmuş çiçek çayı içirdim!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}{{TAG:0003:000F:}}
Lütfen {{TAG:000E:0007:0600680069006D000600680065007200}}'e söyleme!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}I turn on {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}{{TAG:0005:0015:0000}}{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}
{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}and slice my veggies to the beat.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0003:}}I think it's improving my sense of
